.\\n\\n7. **Testing**:\\n   - Test with various inputs, including edge cases like `2048` and `13195`.\\n   - Verify the function handles large numbers efficiently.\\n\\n8. **Documentation**:\\n   - Include the docstring with the provided examples and assumptions.\\n\\nBy following this checklist, the coder can implement the `largest_prime_factor` function correctly and efficiently."}'}]
